@startuml start-payment
title POST /carts/{cart_id}/payments - start a payment

start
:Receive request
header: User-Id
body: payment_method_id;

if (User-Id / payment_method_id missing\nor invalid - cart_id, User-Id and\npayment_method_id must be UUIDs?) then (yes)
  :422 Unprocessable Entity; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif

:Lock the cart (SELECT ... FOR UPDATE);
if (User missing/deleted, cart missing/deleted\nor cart not owned by User-Id?) then (yes)
  :404 Not Found; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif

if (Cart status is not **active**?\nchecked_out or abandoned) then (yes)
  :409 Conflict; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif

if (Cart already has a **pending**\nor **succeeded** payment?) then (yes)
  :409 Conflict; <<#pink>>
  note right
    Also protects against duplicate
    requests (double click, network
    retry): no double charge.
  end note
  stop
endif

if (User has no payment method, or\npayment_method_id is missing/deleted/\nnot the user's?) then (yes)
  :409 Conflict; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif

:Get line items (quantity, unit_price)
from the total calculation service
//(external call, logged)//;

if (Cart is empty?) then (yes)
  :409 Conflict; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif

if (A product in the cart is soft-deleted?) then (yes)
  :409 Conflict; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif

if (Products in different currencies?) then (yes)
  :409 Conflict; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif

:Lock the products (SELECT ... FOR UPDATE);
if (Not enough stock for any item?) then (yes)
  :409 Conflict; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif

:amount = sum(quantity x unit_price);
:Reserve stock (reduce stock_quantity);
:Save payment as **pending**
(amount, currency);
:Commit;

:Call the payment provider to start the charge
(provider_token, amount, currency, payment id)
//(external call, logged)//;

switch (Provider answer?)
case (accepted)
  :Save provider_transaction_id;
  :202 Accepted
  (payment **pending**); <<#palegreen>>
  stop
case (refused the charge\ne.g. invalid card token)
  :Payment -> **failed** (with reason);
  :Give the reserved stock back;
  note right: Cart stays **active**: the user\ncan retry with another method
  :402 Payment Required
  (payment **failed**); <<#pink>>
  stop
case (unreachable, timeout\nor error)
  :Payment -> **failed** (with reason);
  :Give the reserved stock back;
  note right: Cart stays **active**:\nthe user can retry later
  :502 Bad Gateway
  (payment **failed**); <<#pink>>
  stop
endswitch

legend bottom
  A concurrent change of the same cart (StaleDataError) or a
  second active payment for the cart (partial unique index)
  also ends in 409 Conflict.
  Any other unexpected error: rollback and 500 with
  "An unexpected error happened. Log id: <request_id>/<log_id>".
endlegend
@enduml
